<title>USA: Competitive sales total $162 mln for Aug 27.</title>
<headline>Competitive sales total $162 mln for Aug 27.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-08-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Scheduled competitive sales total $161.7 million in 28 offerings for Tuesday, August 27, according to Reuters Municipal Bond Information Group.</p>
<p>Fifteen issues are slated for sale at 1100 EDT.</p>
<p>The largest issue is a $26.7 million Southern Regional HSD, New Jersey, offering at 1100 EDT.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
</text>
